      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 3 mos",
      "description": "As a Software Engineer, I helped develop the critical Ground based Interval Management system  (GIM-S) for the Time Based Flow Management (TBFM) project. This enhancement introduces ADS-B data into the traffic management system and allows for more accurate spacing of arrivals while the flight is in Center control.",
