       }
      },
      "totalDuration": "1 yr 3 mos",
      "description": "I supported the EDSM CSCI of ERAM, once again leveraging my knowledge of Display Command Managment (DCM), as an SE. My primary role is to specify requirements for SW in a way that is understandable, to capture the requirements of our customer (the FAA), and to provide value, safety, and to generally make life easier for Air Traffic Controllers.\n\nIn this role I get to interface with the many CSCIs of ERAM and engineer, at times, complex solutions in the most understandable way possible. This role is broadening my ability to understand the big picture in ATC, as well as allowing my skill set to dig deep into problems that aren't typically within my area of expertise.",
      "insights": ""
