      "totalDuration": "1 yr 8 mos",
      "description": "Supported software development in Air Traffic Control for 1.5 years. In particular, I was part of the SW group for Display Command Management. While in this role I delivered SW for PR fixes, PR Engineering Direction changes, and complex requirements updates specified in SIGs. I delivered a Tiger Team PRED, participated actively and constructively in peer reviews and inspections, and implemented a number of process improvement updates for the team.\n\nI was part of the large ICAO 2012 effort to step up command formatting to recent international standards. I received a SPOT award for my efforts.",
